<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.50 to $1.00 lower than Friday's close. Top $52.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3  230-260 lbs    51.00-52.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3  260-270 lbs    50.00-51.00</p>
<p>		270-280 lbs    49.00-50.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $56.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3  300-500 lbs    41.00-44.00</p>
<p>		over 500 lbs    50.00-56.00</p>
</text>
